 if(r.lineage?.source_group==='banerjee2003'&&entryId)host.append(el('p','Composite diagrams are illustrative. The paper assigns predominantly wurtzite CdTe with possible zinc-blende character or stacking faults; no refined atomic coordinates, measured junction geometry, SAED pattern or source unit-cell file are supplied. Attached particles, washings and no-tube comparison retain separate sample scopes.','guide-notice'));
